  "notes": "{腫|は}れる describes swelling of body parts from injury, infection, allergic reactions, or inflammation.\n\nIchidan verb.\n- Negative: {腫|は}れない\n- Polite: {腫|は}れます\n- Te-form: {腫|は}れて\n- Past: {腫|は}れた\n- Noun form: {腫|は}れ (swelling)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{腫|は}れる: eyes become swollen (from crying or allergy)\n- ⟦{足|あし}→足：00575_ashi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{腫|は}れる: leg/foot swells\n- ⟦{赤|あか}く→赤い：00585_akai⟧{腫|は}れる: to swell up red\n- ⟦{大|おお}きく→大きい：00335_ookii⟧{腫|は}れる: to swell up a lot\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{膨|ふく}れる→膨れる：25246_fukureru⟧: to puff up, to inflate (not medical)\n- ⟦むくむ→むくむ：07354_mukumu⟧: to be puffy, to have edema (water retention)",
